{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "First Day of Work"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Workplace Health  Program"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Analyze issues relating to different topics and their solution in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "detail-oriented"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "attentive to small details"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ms Walkers is very detail-oriented."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about a workplace health program."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brochure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short document in the form of a small book giving factual information on a topic"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In this brochure, you will find information about how we support healthy living."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "non-smoker"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who does not smoke cigarettes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As a non-smoker, I must say I appreciate that."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "strike a balance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "find a middle path between two things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We also believe that all employees need to strike a balance between their work and  personal life. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "immediate supervisor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person in the company who reports to and who evaluates you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Any problem must be signaled to your immediate supervisor, who fills out the appropriate form."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "harassment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of harassing (bothering, disturbing) in the things that are said or done"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Does the policy include harassment?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bullying"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act of trying to control a person by being intimidating or domineering"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The health program also includes measures to combat bullying. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "multidimensional"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "containing many different parts or aspects"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our health program a very multidimensional policy. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le06ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le06ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Causative <span class=\"italic\">Get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Have</span> in the Active Pattern"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use causative <span class=\"italic\">get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">have</span> in active and passive voices. Let's look at how to use the active pattern."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use causative <span class=\"italic\">get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">have</span> in the active voice, it has the meaning of \u201ccause or order someone to do something\u201d.<br/><br/>  The structure looks like this:<br/><br/>  get + person + infinitive (to + verb)<br/> have + person + verb (infinitive without to)<br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">I'll <span class=\"strong\">get the waiter to bring</span> the bill.<br/> I'll <span class=\"strong\">have the waiter bring</span> the bill.<br/><br/></span>  There is a slight difference in meaning between <span class=\"italic\">get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">have</span> in this structure. When you <span class=\"italic\">get</span> someone to do something for you, it implies that you need to convince them in some way. <span class=\"italic\">Have</span> is a little more neutral in meaning."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We get the cafeteria staff to serve healthy meals. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We have professional counsellors come in whenever necessary."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should have other companies implement this policy."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking for Advice: The Modals <span class=\"italic\">Shall</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Should</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you want to ask for advice in a workplace setting, you can use the modal verbs <span class=\"italic\">shall</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These modals, when used in this way, are a polite way of asking for advice. It is important to be as polite as possible when asking for advice in the workplace."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for the structures of <span class=\"italic\">shall</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span> for advice and some examples."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question word + should + subject <br/><br/>  Do you think I should \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you think we should read it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ought to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question word + should + subject <br/><br/>  Do you think I ought to \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you think we ought to participate? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shall<br/><br/>  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Shall</span> is not used as often as <span class=\\\"italic\\\">should</span> and <span class=\\\"italic\\\">ought to</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Question word + should + subject \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> What shall I do?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of the things that were included in BFP's health program for employees in this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Find other things that are sometimes included in company health program."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss the ideas for a company health program. Which ones are very good? Which ones are not necessary?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create the best health program for a company.  Write 150 - 200 describing the health program."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your text for correct spelling and punctuation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your text to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read about company health programs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss ideas for a company health program."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a company health program."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le06ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Good afternoon, Mr. Brody.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Good afternoon. How is your training going?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Very well. Ms. Walkers got us to think about a lot of things.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Yes, she's very detail-oriented. You must be to work in publishing, you know.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I hope we can live up your expectations.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: You mustn't worry about that.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What shall we do now?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Now, I want to talk about a few company policies related to health. We are very proud to have our own Workplace Health Program.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That's interesting.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: In this brochure, you will find information about how we support healthy living. It's a very multidimensional policy.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Do you think we should read it?<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Yes, you should definitely read it. There is a section on healthy eating and active living. We have an employee recreational activity program.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Do you think we ought to participate?", "id": 2, "time": "18250", "image": "engenn10le06ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: I hope you will. We get the cafeteria staff to serve healthy meals. We also enforce a non-smoking policy throughout the building.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: As a non-smoker, I must say I appreciate that.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: We also believe that all employees need to strike a balance between their work and  personal life. We offer stress reduction and time management workshops.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That's cool.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: There's a chapter on ensuring a violence-free work environment. Of course, this means more than physical violence. It means eliminating psychological risk factors. Any problem must be signaled to your immediate supervisor, who fills out the appropriate form.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Does the policy include harassment and bullying?<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Absolutely. All of those issues are intimately tied to workplace health. We have professional counsellors come in whenever necessary. Our employees needn't feel they are alone.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: This all sounds fantastic. You should have other companies implement this policy.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Thank you. I must say I agree with you there.", "id": 3, "time": "48400", "image": "engenn10le06ob06re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can explain how the workplace health and safety procedures are.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express necessity, duty, and advice. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask someone to do something.  "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Is there a health program at your workplace? What does it include?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think it would be useful to have a health program at all workplaces? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Healthy hearts ... healthy minds!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nMr. Brody talks with Kristin and Adam about the Workplace Health Program at BFP Publishing. They are <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">on the right track</span>!\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"tip_id": 0, "type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"italic\">\"On the right track\"</span> means headed in the correct direction or doing the correct thing."}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n"}]}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You "}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "be very detail-oriented to work in publishing. "}}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "must"}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "needn't"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You "}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "worry that we won't live up to your expectations. "}}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 1, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "need to"}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "mustn't"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "We believe that all employees"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "strike a balance between their work and  personal life. "}}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "id": 2, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "needn't"}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "need to"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You "}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "definitely read the Workplace Health Program."}}, {"type": 